With the victory of <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformist</span> [? if president == "Bristol": Lyle Bristol?][? if president == "Pendrigon": Cael Pendrigon?], an uptick in paramilitary violence has been seen, and even rumors of a <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> coup. Heartland Minister of the Interior Joshua Heath has ordered an emergency search of all <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> offices throughout the state.

During the raids, evidence was uncovered that the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> Party headquarters in Avriza had ordered to place <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> units on high alert after the election. In the event of a [+ marcher_candidate_1932 +] victory, these units were to immediately launch a coup d’état, which included the planned seizure of military installations and weaponry.

The threat of a coup has granted the newly elected President a pretext to issue a nationwide ban of the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span>, an opinion shared by many non-<span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> state governments. However, the more conservative, non-<span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> elements of the Commonwealth right, as well as the Commonwealth Army itself, do not share our sense of alarm over the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span>’s supposed coup plans and see no need for immediate action.

- @sa_ban_braun_2: We will use this revelation to commence a nationwide ban on the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span>!
- @sa_ban_pressure_braun: We will leverage this revelation to pressure the Interior Ministry into banning the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> nationwide!
- @sa_ban_bruning_braun: We will present this damning evidence to Interior Minister [? if second_bruning_cabinet_seen: Roland Ravabelle?][? if not second_bruning_cabinet_seen: Joseph Werth?] and use [+ president +] to pressure him for a nationwide ban on the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span>.

@sa_ban_braun_2
