on-arrival: loyalist_strength *= 0.65; loyalist_strength *= 0.7 if ((interior_police_loyalty + heartland_police_loyalty) >= 1.4) and not loyalist_banned; loyalist_militancy -= 0.1; loyalist_militancy -= 0.05 if ((interior_police_loyalty + heartland_police_loyalty) >= 1.4) and not loyalist_banned; loyalist_banned = 1; loyalist_nationwide_ban = 1; loyalist_banned_pro = 1 if (interior_police_loyalty + heartland_police_loyalty) >= 1.4; loyalist_banned_pro = 0 if (interior_police_loyalty + heartland_police_loyalty) < 1.4; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.05; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05; loyalist_ban_timer = 6; loyalist_coup_progress = coup_progress; coup_progress -= 2 if coup_progress >= 6; interior_goal_heartland -= 1; dufour_angry += 25; left_dissent -= 10; labor_dissent -= 5; disfavored_royalist -= 5; commons_royalist -= 3; burgher_royalist -= 3

With control of the Interior Ministry, we have used these revelations as a pretext to ban the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> nationwide, for their anti-constitutional plot to overthrow the government. This move has led to a noticeable decline in political violence, delivering a significant blow to the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span>, who had relied heavily on intimidation tactics to secure votes.

However, a leak about the ban managed to get out, allowing the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> to hide many of their weapons from being seized. [? if loyalist_banned_pro: Nevertheless, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> has been significantly weakened by the ban. ?]

